# `BUCK` is in srcs because `no_buck_target_enables_the_model` reads this file.
# It is a LITERAL PATTERN INSIDE the glob, not `glob([...]) + ["BUCK"]`: the
# concatenation builds the same file set for buck2 and an UNREADABLE one for
# ci/facade/embedded-asset-hermeticity, whose parse_srcs models `glob(...)` and
# a bare list but falls to `_ => unparseable` on a binary `+` of the two.
